The confirmatory run does not test the fitted helmet, the deeper bands, localization, the noise-model alternatives of Section~\ref{sec:S3} or a covariance mismatch of the detector. Its detector remains idealized in the ways named in the main text (Section 4.4), and the mismatch variant is one declared departure, not a model of clinical review.
